# FIGMA DESIGN SPECIFICATION & ASSETS
Project: Student Freelance & Part-time Job Marketplace
Team: Nhóm 8 (Chuyên đề tốt nghiệp 2 - ĐH Văn Lang)

Figma Project URL: https://www.figma.com/file/marketplace-freelance-student-team8
Design Tokens:
- Primary Color: #2563EB (Blue 600)
- Secondary Color: #10B981 (Emerald 500)
- Background Dark: #0F172A (Slate 900)
- Background Light: #F8FAFC (Slate 50)
- Typography: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto

Screens Included:
1. Public: Home Landing Page, Job Browse & Multi-filter, Job Details with Apply modal
2. Auth: Login, Register with role selector (Student / Employer)
3. Student Portal: Dashboard, My Applications Tracker, Profile Edit & CV link
4. Employer Portal: Dashboard, Post Job Form, My Jobs Manager, Applicants Review Modal
5. Admin Portal: Dashboard Stats, Users Management (Active/Deactivate), Job Moderation
6. Interactive HTML Wireframe available at: docs/wireframes.html
